i:p001:r0032","surface":"河東王","start":32,"end":35,"person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p001","quote":"勱字公齊，美風儀，博涉書史，恬然清簡，未嘗以利欲幹懷。仕梁為輕車河東王功曹史。王出鎮京口，勱將隨之蕃。范陽張纘時典選舉，勱造纘言別，纘嘉其風采，乃曰：「王生才地，豈可遊外府乎？」奏為太子洗馬。後為南徐州別駕從事史。","note":"按王府、敘事時段及陳書平行傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangmai-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p001:r0039","surface":"王","start":39,"end":40,"person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p001","quote":"勱字公齊，美風儀，博涉書史，恬然清簡，未嘗以利欲幹懷。仕梁為輕車河東王功曹史。王出鎮京口，勱將隨之蕃。范陽張纘時典選舉，勱造纘言別，纘嘉其風采，乃曰：「王生才地，豈可遊外府乎？」奏為太子洗馬。後為南徐州別駕從事史。","note":"按王府、敘事時段及陳書平行傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangmai-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p001:r0048","surface":"之","start":48,"end":49,"person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p001","quote":"勱字公齊，美風儀，博涉書史，恬然清簡，未嘗以利欲幹懷。仕梁為輕車河東王功曹史。王出鎮京口，勱將隨之蕃。范陽張纘時典選舉，勱造纘言別，纘嘉其風采，乃曰：「王生才地，豈可遊外府乎？」奏為太子洗馬。後為南徐州別駕從事史。","note":"按王府、敘事時段及陳書平行傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangmai-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p003:r0001","surface":"河東王","start":1,"end":4,"person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p003","quote":"時河東王為廣州刺史，乃以勱為冠軍河東王長史、南海太守。王至嶺南，多所侵掠，因懼罪稱疾，委州還朝，勱行州府事。越中饒沃，前後守宰，例多貪縱，勱獨以清白著聞。入為給事黃門侍郎。","note":"按王府、敘事時段及陳書平行傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangmai-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p003:r0016","surface":"河東王","start":16,"end":19,"person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p003","quote":"時河東王為廣州刺史，乃以勱為冠軍河東王長史、南海太守。王至嶺南，多所侵掠，因懼罪稱疾，委州還朝，勱行州府事。越中饒沃，前後守宰，例多貪縱，勱獨以清白著聞。入為給事黃門侍郎。","note":"按王府、敘事時段及陳書平行傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangmai-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p003:r0027","surface":"王","start":27,"end":28,"person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p003","quote":"時河東王為廣州刺史，乃以勱為冠軍河東王長史、南海太守。王至嶺南，多所侵掠，因懼罪稱疾，委州還朝，勱行州府事。越中饒沃，前後守宰，例多貪縱，勱獨以清白著聞。入為給事黃門侍郎。","note":"按王府、敘事時段及陳書平行傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangmai","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangmai-ws2478204"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[{"parent_person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","scope":"sons_of_parent","ordinal":2,"position":"unspecified","source_term":"第二子","interpretation_status":"source_attested","assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangmai-yu-father","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-055","source_id":"s-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent-ws1530936","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent:p001","quote":"河東王譽字重孫，昭明太子第二子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent:p001:m0003","object_person_reference_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent:p001:r0008"}]}],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[{"parent_person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","scope":"sons_of_parent","ordinal":2,"position":"unspecified","source_term":"第二子","interpretation_status":"source_attested","assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangmai-yu-father","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4_A","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-055","source_id":"s-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent-ws1530936","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent:p001","quote":"河東王譽字重孫，昭明太子第二子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent:p001:m0003","object_person_reference_id":"c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent:p001:r0008"}]}],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001","text":"勱字公濟，通之弟也。美風儀，博涉書史，恬然清簡，未嘗以利欲干懷。梁世為國子周易生，射策舉高第，除祕書郎、太子舍人、宣惠武陵王主簿、輕車河東王功曹史。王出鎮京口，勱將隨之藩，范陽張纘時典選舉，勱造纘言別，纘嘉其風采，乃曰：「王生才地，豈可游外府乎？」奏為太子洗馬。遷中舍人，司徒左西屬。出為南徐州別駕從事史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":36,"last_line":36,"raw_start":1679,"raw_end":1883,"raw_character_offsets":[1679,1680,1681,1682,1683,1735,1736,1737,1738,1739,1740,1741,1742,1743,1744,1745,1746,1747,1748,1749,1750,1751,1752,1753,1754,1755,1756,1757,1758,1759,1760,1761,1762,1763,1764,1765,1766,1767,1768,1769,1770,1771,1772,1773,1774,1775,1776,1777,1778,1779,1780,1781,1782,1783,1784,1785,1786,1787,1788,1789,1790,1791,1792,1793,1794,1795,1796,1797,1798,1799,1800,1801,1802,1803,1804,1805,1806,1807,1808,1809,1810,1811,1812,1813,1814,1815,1816,1817,1818,1819,1820,1821,1822,1823,1824,1825,1826,1827,1828,1829,1830,1831,1832,1833,1834,1835,1836,1837,1838,1839,1840,1841,1842,1843,1844,1845,1846,1847,1848,1849,1850,1851,1852,1853,1854,1855,1856,1857,1858,1859,1860,1861,1862,1863,1864,1865,1866,1867,1868,1869,1870,1871,1872,1873,1874,1875,1876,1877,1878,1879,1880,1881,1882],"revision_id":1544244},"mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"勱","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"公濟","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001:m0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"武陵王","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_D","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001:m0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"河東王","kind":